cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GeoCCMM, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "GeoCCMM: a metadata application profile for geospatial research data"
version: 1.0.0
abstract: >-
  GeoCCMM is a metadata application profile for geospatial research data in
  CLARIN-DSpace. One record with 34 fields maps to CCMM 1.1.0, INSPIRE
  (ISO 19139, Technical Guidelines 2.2.1) and DataCite 4.6 metadata.
  Prototype.
authors:
  - family-names: "Černík"
    given-names: "Jáchym"
    affiliation: "Charles University"
keywords:
  - metadata
  - application profile
  - geospatial data
  - INSPIRE
  - CCMM
  - DataCite
  - DSpace
